432	     * Whether this owner was flagged at creation as approaching the per-city capacity limit: its city
433	     * already held between 40 and 49 owners (inclusive) at the moment this owner was created, close to
434	     * the hard limit of 50. The owner is still created; this flag is advisory.
435	     */
436	    public boolean isCapacityWarning() {
